Design validated by the user (conception_boussole_NSOE.html). No scorer change.

NEW FILES:
- src/data/boussoleData.ts : 4 caps (NORD انظر / SUD اجمع / OUEST اغص / EST أشرق)
  with gesture, mechanical question, 3 micro-actions, motor phrase, colors;
  VENT_CAP_MAP (each ERROR_TAXONOMY tag -> cap where the wind blows);
  groupErrorsByCap(); BOUSSOLE_STAGES_META (pills); regle d'or.
- src/components/CompassRose.tsx : SVG rose with smooth needle rotation
  (CSS transform) + active cap halo + Arabic cardinal labels.
- src/components/BoussolePanel.tsx : compass + 4 cap cards + grade chip
  (نوتي/ملاح/ربان/قبطان أعالي البحار) + regle d'or, collapsible.

MethodologyCompilerView.tsx:
- tab renamed 'بوصلة NSOE · المحاكي'; stage pills renamed N/S/O/E with
  cap colors + 'كاب الآن' active chip; titles capped (المرحلة 1 — كاب الشمال...)
- BoussolePanel inserted above the stages (needle follows currentStage)
- correction now includes « تقرير الملاحة NSOE » : per-cap ✓/✗ with the
  wind errors (error tags grouped by cap) + reminder of the 4 checks (EST)
- ICM renamed 'علامة الملاحة' (label + badge)
- faithful counts: 'فهرس الأفعال الـ 12' (was 8), 'مصفوفة الإتقان وخريطة الرياح'

methodologyLog.ts:
- getNavigatorGrade() computed ONLY from real notebook data:
  مبتدئ -> نوتي (1st run) -> ملاح (5 runs + 1 clean) -> ربان (avg>=75 on 3 verbs)
  -> قبطان أعالي البحار (ICM>=90 in >=3 units)
